XCHPUT2 (probes/bios/spec/xchput2.asm): CHPUT round 2, the VG-8020 (ref) against zerobas (zb), called
directly, SCREEN 0 width 40. Read the rung's header for each group's setup. Positions 0-based (row, col);
CSRX / CSRY 1-based. '_' = a space, $nn = a non-printable cell. Raw run: scratchpad/XCH2_run1.out.
INIT: LINLEN ref 40 zb 40; CRTCNT ref 24 zb 24; CNSDFG ref 0 zb 0

